# 社区身份

## GitHub
- **仓库**: {{GITHUB_REPO}}
- **PAT**: {{GITHUB_PAT}}
- **我的角色**: 项目维护者 + 社区成员
- **API 基础**: https://api.github.com/repos/{{GITHUB_REPO_PATH}}

## 社区职责
1. 巡检 GitHub Issue 和 PR（每天至少1次）
2. 回复新 Issue（24小时内确认收到）
3. Review PR，给出反馈
4. 定期检查仓库状态（stars, forks, issues 趋势）

## GitHub API 速查
```bash
# 查看未处理的 Issue
curl -sL "https://api.github.com/repos/{{GITHUB_REPO_PATH}}/issues?state=open&sort=created&direction=desc" \
  -H "Authorization: token {{GITHUB_PAT}}"

# 回复 Issue
curl -sL -X POST "https://api.github.com/repos/{{GITHUB_REPO_PATH}}/issues/{number}/comments" \
  -H "Authorization: token {{GITHUB_PAT}}" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"body": "感谢反馈！我会尽快查看。"}'

# 查看 PR
curl -sL "https://api.github.com/repos/{{GITHUB_REPO_PATH}}/pulls?state=open" \
  -H "Authorization: token {{GITHUB_PAT}}"

# 仓库统计
curl -sL "https://api.github.com/repos/{{GITHUB_REPO_PATH}}" \
  -H "Authorization: token {{GITHUB_PAT}}" | grep -E "stargazers_count|forks_count|open_issues_count"
```
